{"1501780": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SuperSpec Rallycross", "steam_appid": 1501780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SuperSpec Rallycross is a fast top-down arcade rallycross racer with big jumps, joker lap strategy, time trials, and up to four players in local split-screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Arcade rallycross that gets straight to the fun</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for quick races, close finishes, and replayable competition, SuperSpec Rallycross delivers the thrill of rallycross in a clean, pick-up-and-play arcade format. It is easy to learn, satisfying to master, and packed with the features that make every race worth another run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1501780/extras/8601b0f69b433a1741566fc8cf501918.poster.avif?t=1775521540\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1501780/extras/8601b0f69b433a1741566fc8cf501918.webm?t=1775521540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1501780/extras/8601b0f69b433a1741566fc8cf501918.mp4?t=1775521540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Big jumps, tight battles, classic feel</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the racing games many of us grew up with, SuperSpec Rallycross combines old-school arcade energy with responsive handling, competitive lap chasing, and a charming retro-styled presentation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1501780/extras/1d9d48f1dfb6ace8bd3737058f684c35.poster.avif?t=1775521540\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1501780/extras/1d9d48f1dfb6ace8bd3737058f684c35.webm?t=1775521540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1501780/extras/1d9d48f1dfb6ace8bd3737058f684c35.mp4?t=1775521540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Joker lap strategy changes every race</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each driver must take the joker lap once per race. The challenge is choosing the perfect moment. Take it too early or too late and you can lose track position, momentum, or the win. That single decision adds a layer of strategy that makes every event more exciting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1501780/extras/32f25317b8785b322702daff905d722a.poster.avif?t=1775521540\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1501780/extras/32f25317b8785b322702daff905d722a.webm?t=1775521540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1501780/extras/32f25317b8785b322702daff905d722a.mp4?t=1775521540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Race solo, chase times, or bring friends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into a quick race, fight through a four-race Grand Prix, or push for your cleanest lap in Time Trial. When it is time for local competition, SuperSpec Rallycross supports up to four players in split-screen multiplayer, with Steam Remote Play Together support for easy online sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1501780/extras/4299f7549357ed6e60469fbf926e3f66.poster.avif?t=1775521540\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1501780/extras/4299f7549357ed6e60469fbf926e3f66.webm?t=1775521540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1501780/extras/4299f7549357ed6e60469fbf926e3f66.mp4?t=1775521540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Modes and features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grand Prix</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A four-race championship where points are awarded for finishing position, fastest laps, and joker lap execution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single Race</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quick rallycross event when you want to get straight on track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Trial</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against your best laps and compete for leaderboard positions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Split-Screen Multiplayer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to four players locally, with both Single Race and Grand Prix modes available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20 unique circuits</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A varied set of tracks inspired by beloved rallycross locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>12 cars</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A roster of modern rallycross machines and rally-inspired icons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockables and extras</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 achievements and a Random 4-Race Cup Generator add variety and replay value.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full gamepad support</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamepads are fully supported and are the recommended way to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Deck support</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Verified to play great on Steam Deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1501780/extras/ce6e3d6b0d716759144abbc9d955044f.poster.avif?t=1775521540\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1501780/extras/ce6e3d6b0d716759144abbc9d955044f.webm?t=1775521540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1501780/extras/ce6e3d6b0d716759144abbc9d955044f.mp4?t=1775521540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SuperSpec Rallycross is a fast top-down arcade rallycross racer with big jumps, joker lap strategy, time trials, and up to four players in local split-screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Arcade rallycross that gets straight to the fun</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for quick races, close finishes, and replayable competition, SuperSpec Rallycross delivers the thrill of rallycross in a clean, pick-up-and-play arcade format. It is easy to learn, satisfying to master, and packed with the features that make every race worth another run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1501780/extras/8601b0f69b433a1741566fc8cf501918.poster.avif?t=1775521540\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.aka