 compete for leaderboard positions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Split-Screen Multiplayer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to four players locally, with both Single Race and Grand Prix modes available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20 unique circuits</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A varied set of tracks inspired by beloved rallycross locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>12 cars</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A roster of modern rallycross machines and rally-inspired icons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockables and extras</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 achievements and a Random 4-Race Cup Generator add variety and replay value.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full gamepad support</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamepads are fully supported and are the recommended way to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Deck support</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Verified to play great on Steam Deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1501780/extras/ce6e3d6b0d716759144abbc9d955044f.poster.avif?t=1775521540\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1501780/extras/ce6e3d6b0d716759144abbc9d955044f.webm?t=1775521540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1501780/extras/ce6e3d6b0d716759144abbc9d955044f.mp4?t=1775521540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Top-down arcade rallycross with big jumps, joker-lap strategy, time trials, and 4-player local s